@Host = http://localhost:5062

### Fetch player profile analytics (replace with target account ID)
GET {{Host}}/api/MahjongStats/profile/12345678
Accept: application/json

### Ingest and sync live player matches into database
POST {{Host}}/api/MahjongStats/sync/12345678
Accept: application/json

### Audit database record counts and latest matches
GET {{Host}}/api/IngestionTest/db/summary
Accept: application/json

### Search player by nickname
GET {{Host}}/api/IngestionTest/player/ExampleNickname
Accept: application/json
